# Industrial Matte design contract

- Canvas black is `#0a0a0a` (`--im-bg-page`, `--site-page-bg`, `--app-canvas-bg`).
- Chrome, nav, and marketing cards stay `rounded-none`. Soft radius only via `--im-tool-radius` on tool interiors.
- Do not add glow, pulse, blur orbs, or `rounded-full` pills on promo/partner surfaces.
- Promo budget: intro side rails (`ToolIntroSideBanners`) are the primary cross-promo; do not reintroduce home/hub launch strips.
- Partner links use `PromoSurface` (matte hairline + flat CTA).
- Prefer intentional enter/exit motion; avoid decorative `animate-pulse`.
- Side rails: measure free CSS width — both ≥~1200px, one rail intermediate, none when center would be under ~480px or height ≤520px.
